[[Blaze Slayer]] is a [[Slayer|Slayer Quest]] that involves killing [[Blaze]]s and at the end the [[Inferno Demonlord]]. A {{SlayerTier|III}} [[Voidgloom Seraph]] must be slain to unlock '''Blaze Slayer'''.

